       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet because the dose looks wrong and I'd like you to confirm it first.\n\n**The problem:**\n- **1600 mg per dose** is twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Four times daily** makes that **6400 mg per day**, which is twice the usual prescription maximum of 3200 mg per day.\n- Doses this high raise the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury and heart problems, even in a patient with normal kidney and liver function.\n\n**What you may have meant:**\n- **400 mg by mouth four times daily** (1600 mg per day total). This is common if \"1600\" was the daily total.\n- **800 mg by mouth three or four times daily** (2400\u20133200 mg per day), if you want the highest standard dose.\n- Something else.\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it right away. If you really do mean 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that and give me the clinical reason so I can add it to the order note."
      }
